# Model assets are hashed byte-for-byte (meshes/parts/*/manifest.json,
# robotiq_description/UPSTREAM_FILES.json). Never convert their line endings
# on checkout or commit; keep the bytes produced by tools/split_robot_meshes.py
# or the pinned upstream source. AX_1.obj/.mtl intentionally keep CRLF.
*.obj -text
*.mtl -text
*.dae -text
*.stl -text
